     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\">Hola R users,</span><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\">\r\n\r\nL&#39;organitzador dels Data Tuesday Barcelona ens ha escrit explicant en que consisteix per si hi volem anar. Tot i que de moment no sabem quin perfil va a la reunió intentarem que algú vagi a explicar les bondats de l&#39;R.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><br></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">Hi,</span></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">I&#39;m the organizer of Data Tuesday Barcelona, this is a monthly networking event for people interested in &quot;data&quot;:</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">- Big Data</span></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\">\r\n\r\n<i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">- Open Data</span></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">- Data Visualization and Data Journalism.</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">I believe that R users might be interested by this and incidentaly there still are &quot;Data&quot; people who do know know the wast powers of R :-)</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">The first &quot;launch meeting&quot; is on the 23rd of July and the second meeting (focusing on data visualization) will be on the 24 th of september.</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">This is a free meeting, the model is :</span></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\">\r\n\r\n<i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">we start around 7:30 pm, have 5 to 10 very short &quot;pitches&quot; about :</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">- Projects</span></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\">\r\n\r\n<i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">- tools</span></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">- policies</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">After 60 to 90 minutes (did I mention that the pitches are short :-)) the assistance can connect with the speakers and discuss in more details about whatever interest them</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">We got free beer &amp; bretzels.</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">I hope you would find this interesting, and will circulate it within your group, and would personally be thrilled if one of you would be willing to make a very short introduction into the marvels of R.</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">It could be anything that fits into 5 to 10 minutes: either a &quot;layman&#39;s&quot; introduction or let&#39;s flabbergast and awe the public and explain how R + a cheap GPU can look at thousands of elements and extract &quot;anomalies&quot; in &quot;real time&quot;</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">(something like this : </span><a href=\"http://www.r-tutor.com/gpu-computing/clustering/distance-matrix\" style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-tutor.com/gpu-computing/clustering/distance-matrix&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242710846000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2sldTOJInkEU1nKdpcrwzV\">http://www.r-tutor.com/gpu-<u></u>computing/clustering/distance-<u></u>matrix</a><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">).</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">If you are interested the registration page is </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Data-Tuesday-Barcelona\" style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.meetup.com/Data-Tuesday-Barcelona&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242710846000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ulQ4h1FcD1DVNiz6lLXnx\">http://www.meetup.com/Data-<u></u>Tuesday-Barcelona</a><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"> and we have a web site (currently in English but hopefully we&#39;ll be fixing this in a couple of hours) </span><a href=\"http://www.data-tuesday.es/\" style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.data-tuesday.es/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793242710846000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Sf6y-FoZ7ejuZr2U0__rZ\">www.data-tuesday.es</a></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">nb: the pitch can be in english, spanish or catalan.</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"></i></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">  Best Regards</span></i></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\"><i><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><font color=\"#888888\">     Patrick Sinz</font></span></i></div></blockquote><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.800000190734863px\">\r\n\r\n<i><br style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;font-size:small\">ps: sorry for the short head&#39;s up, I only today became aware of the fact that there was an R user group in BCN...</span></i><br>\r\n\r\n</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div>Lluís Ramon</div>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><br></div></div></div>\r\n"
